{
  "title": "20th Jumada al-Akhirah (Birthday of Lady Fatimah al-Zahra (s.a.))",
  "data": "It is proper to observe fasting.\nIt is recommended to give alms and offer good things to the believers.\nIt is recommended to visit Lady Fatimah al-Zahra’(a.s.) - the Doyenne of the women of this world as well as the world to come - by saying the forms of Ziyarah: [Ziyarat of Lady Fatimah al-Zahra](G52).",
  "merits": "On the twentieth of Jamadi al-Akhirah, Lady Fatimah al-Zahra’(a.s.) was born five or two years after the beginning of the Holy Prophet’s Divine Mission."
}
